{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this version, you\u2019ll get the chance to experience a good portion of the game\u2019s content. You\u2019ll meet nearly 20 different fish species and decorate your space with a wide variety of aquariums and desktop items, while enjoying direct access to the following features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989040/extras/1f9fe383208fdc2a66bd8cca626e8fc0.poster.avif?t=1758704925\" width=500 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989040/extras/1f9fe383208fdc2a66bd8cca626e8fc0.webm?t=1758704925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989040/extras/1f9fe383208fdc2a66bd8cca626e8fc0.mp4?t=1758704925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989040/extras/6250e3a78de8f1614167c6777985b23f.webp?t=1758704925\" width=331 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Buy fish and unlock new species <br>\u2022 Breed fish to discover higher rarity and tier <br>\u2022 Feed your fish to keep them happy <br>\u2022 Earn money over time even while idle <br>\u2022 Decorate cozy tanks with plants, rocks, sand castles, and ornaments <br>\u2022 Customize your desk with cups, lamps, speakers, wizards, and more <br>\u2022 Place cute figures around your tank stands <br>\u2022 Relax with calm lo-fi music in the background <br>\u2022 Horizontal scrolling lets you manage all your tanks <br>\u2022 A peaceful idle game that lives at the bottom of your screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989040/extras/cbb9de57b36ced6eb365cbc4e3211e93.poster.avif?t=1758704925\" width=500 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989040/extras/cbb9de57b36ced6eb365cbc4e3211e93.webm?t=1758704925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989040/extras/cbb9de57b36ced6eb365cbc4e3211e93.mp4?t=1758704925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989040?t=1758704925","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989040/830602812cd3486c3941cf0042fc02d5c4a67fa5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758704925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989040/b013b85dcc80abb9bac895d1419547535dc09823/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758704925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989040/b013b85dcc80abb9bac895d1419547535dc09823/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758704925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this version, you\u2019ll get the chance to experience a good portion of the game\u2019s content. You\u2019ll meet nearly 20 different fish species and decorate your space with a wide variety of aquariums and desktop items, while enjoying direct access to the following features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto